{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113080","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1111308001:1":{"text":"라이스 형, 뜸 들이지 말고 얼른 이야기해줘! 그래서 사막의 발톱을 어떻게 물리쳤는데!","source_cn":"诡草大哥，你说重点嘛！仔细说说你是怎么打败流沙之爪的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5AB0DEAF2F40415","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111308002:1":{"text":"너희도 알다시피 나는 초코보 조련 전문가잖아? 그래서 그놈들의 초코보를 돌봐주는 척하면서 조용히 초코보 군단을 만들었지.","source_cn":"你们也知道，我可是驯养陆行鸟的专家！我一面给他们养鸟，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD06EC1D60EAF9A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111308003:1":{"text":"와! 초코보 군단!","source_cn":"哇！陆行鸟军团！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6BAA7ABB887A70F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111308004:0":{"text":"그래 초코보 군단!! 그리고 사랑하는 나의 <style=\"highlight\">블레이즈 윙</style>이 군단을 이끌었지!","source_cn":"没错，我的爱鸟<style=highlight>炽翼冲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B68EE4B3ECA3FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111308005:0":{"text":"그래서? 그다음엔?!","source_cn":"然后呢然后呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF00D2F7B8BED81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111308006:1":{"text":"그다음엔... 붉은 달이 뜬 밤에... 초코보 군단을 이끌고 프랭크가 있는 본거지로 쳐들어갔어!","source_cn":"然后啊……在那红月高升的夜晚……我率领陆行鸟军团冲进了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1067EA54A21C65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111308007:1":{"text":"빵야! 나는 총을 하나, 둘, 셋, 넷, 다섯, 여섯! 총 여섯 방을 쐈고!","source_cn":"嘭！我开了一枪、两枪、三枪、四枪、五枪、六枪！总共六发子弹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE59174E761CFBC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111308008:0":{"text":"그때 놈들의 본거지에서 살아남은 건 오직 나와 초코보 군단뿐이었지!","source_cn":"这时候，整个大本营内，只剩下我和陆行鸟军团还站着不倒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED916D49745B91A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111308009:0":{"text":"와... 대단해...","source_cn":"哇……听上去好厉害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA2269650009E0A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111308010:0":{"text":"거짓말이야.","source_cn":"他撒谎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E13884672993938","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111308011:0":{"text":"엑? 거짓말이야?","source_cn":"咦！是骗人的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0597296F7484A76A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111308012:0":{"text":"이봐, 거기 라이스. 허풍 꽤나 떠는데?","source_cn":"喂，那个叫诡草的。你的肺不错啊，很擅长吹牛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E9F817920753EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111308013:0":{"text":"누가 허풍을 떤다고... 다, 당신들이 여긴 어떻게?!","source_cn":"谁说我吹牛——怎、怎么是你们几个？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF9224799AD2B44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111308014:1":{"text":"나도 우리가 다시 만날 줄은 상상도 못 했는 걸. 사막의 발톱의 새 조련사 씨?","source_cn":"我也没想到会和你再见，流沙之爪的养鸟人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1930F81A7E8BBCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111308015:1":{"text":"새 조련사라니! 그렇게 부르지 마!\n초코보는 평범한 새가 아니야, 사막을 가로지르는 질풍이라고!","source_cn":"什么养鸟人啊！不准用那种称呼叫我！\\n陆行鸟可不是普通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E34D542B5B175EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111308016:1":{"text":"아니... 이게 중요한 게 아니지 지금!\n여긴 어쩐 일이지? 썩 꺼지지 못해!","source_cn":"不对……重点不是这个！\\n你们怎么会在这？快给我滚蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84902F9104D554C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111308017:0":{"text":"라이스 형, 저 사람들은 누구야?","source_cn":"诡草大哥，他们是什么人呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C739B0E141B3A80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1111308018:1":{"text":"그... 그게... 사막의 발톱에게서 운 좋게 도망친 포로들이야!","source_cn":"这个……那个……他、他们是侥幸从流沙之爪手底下逃出来的俘虏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E3D769A60FD7219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111308019:1":{"text":"내가 없었다면 진작에 독수리한테 잡아먹혔을 거야!","source_cn":"要是没有我，估计早被老鹰吃掉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42E09BBB23CCEEE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1111308020:0":{"text":"어디 한 번 계속해 보시지?","source_cn":"你再编？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B83381853196F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111308021:0":{"text":"다, 다 지나간 일이잖아... 다들 힘들게 거기서 빠져나왔는데, 옛날 얘기는 이제 그만하자고!","source_cn":"都、都过去了……大家好不容易离开那个地方，这些破事就别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C1BB306A0E22F72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1111308022:0":{"text":"네가 먼저 시작한 거잖아.","source_cn":"可不是我主动提的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A836F80ACDE49D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1111308023:0":{"text":"형도 진짜 멋지다! 당당히 승리하고 돌아온 영웅이네!","source_cn":"大哥哥，你们也很棒！也是凯旋的英雄呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2885365DBAFCE115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1111308024:0":{"text":"라이스 형을 위한 축하 파티를 열 건데, 형도 오지 않을래? 그러지 말고 좀 웃어줘 형~","source_cn":"我们正准备给诡草大哥举行庆功宴会！你们也一起庆祝吧！不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x215611A6BCEDC707","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1111308025:0":{"text":"...좋아, 널 봐서라도 더 이상 따지지 않겠어.","source_cn":"……好吧，看在你们的面子上，不跟那家伙计较了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9F102DA2FAE158C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:34:1111308023":{"text":"형도 진짜 멋지다! 당당히 승리하고 돌아온 영웅이네!","source_cn":"哇！大哥哥，你们也很棒！也是凯旋的英雄呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2885365DBAFCE115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1111308026:0":{"text":"울면 골치 아프니까.","source_cn":"万一哭了，很麻烦。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3138DE0306DA2BFD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"울면 골치 아프니까.","female":"울면 골치 아프니까.","variant_male_record_index":"123942","variant_female_record_index":"123943","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1111308028:0":{"text":"같이 축하 파티라니, 난 싫어!","source_cn":"谁要和他们一起庆祝！我不同意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EE2F21B39616E28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1111308029:0":{"text":"큰일이야, 라이스 형! 큰일 났어!","source_cn":"糟了糟了！诡草大哥不好啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25825B15802FF2E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1111308030:0":{"text":"왜 그러는데... 왜 갑자기 호들갑이야?","source_cn":"怎么了……别大惊小怪，没看见我正忙着吵架吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0435E6D6F5043E47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1111308031:0":{"text":"라이스 형, 형이 구해온 초코보가 전부 도망쳤어!","source_cn":"诡草大哥，你救回来的小陆行鸟都跑了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182F2E8A70AD55EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1111308032:0":{"text":"뭐? 똑바로 보고 있으라고 했잖아!","source_cn":"什么？说了一百次让你们看好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C59DF65285E0A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1111308033:0":{"text":"흥! 이봐, 곰탱이! 이 일은 나중에 다시 결판내자고. 일단 난 먼저 간다!","source_cn":"哼！熊耳朵！回头再跟你算账，我有事先忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FC34E41B4351E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:34:0:1":{"text":"아이들한테 진짜 약하구나","source_cn":"你拿小孩子没办法啊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x09B6300D41280D65","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아이들한테 진짜 약하구나","female":"아이들한테 진짜 약하구나","variant_male_record_index":"63958","variant_female_record_index":"63959","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1111308027:0":{"text":"아니. 그까짓 게 뭐라고.","source_cn":"才不是，谁稀罕。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8FB24933A6A14820","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아니. 그까짓 게 뭐라고.","female":"아니. 그까짓 게 뭐라고.","variant_male_record_index":"123944","variant_female_record_index":"123945","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:34:1:2":{"text":"영웅이라고 불리는 게 좋아?","source_cn":"你喜欢被叫大英雄？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2EC9325CA7826DE8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"영웅이라고 불리는 게 좋아?","female":"영웅이라고 불리는 게 좋아?","variant_male_record_index":"63960","variant_female_record_index":"63961","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fem